  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A clear stone cut in the shape of a heart, hung on a gold chain. It throws colors on the wall in a dark room, and the colors move like something breathing.</p><p>Each dawn, choose two damage types other than Bludgeoning, Piercing and Slashing. Until the next dawn you have Resistance to both while you wear the amulet.</p><p><strong>Drink the Light.</strong> Once per day, when you take damage of one of the two chosen types, you can use your Reaction to take none of it and regain that many Hit Points instead. The amulet regains this power at dawn.</p><p><strong>A Memory in Glass.</strong> The wearer can seal one memory in the stone and hand the amulet to someone else, who lives through that memory once as if it were their own. The stone holds one memory at a time, and the memory is gone from the stone, though not from the giver, once it has been lived.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
